<title>TAIWAN: Earthquake hits Taiwan, no damage reported.</title>
<headline>Earthquake hits Taiwan, no damage reported.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>An earthquake hit Taiwan on Wednesday, but there were no immediate reports of damage or casualties, weather officials and police said.</p>
<p>The quake was felt in the capital Taipei where buildings swayed for about 50 seconds and in most parts of the island. The tremor's magnitude was not yet available, the Central Weather Bureau said.</p>
